      "description": "Here is my [black dragon design](https://goo.gl/xpvgrk) with Idle animation.\nI modeled, textured and rigged this dragon in [Blender](https://www.blender.org/) 2013.\n[![black-dragon-rigged-and-game-ready](https://goo.gl/Ve2K0R)](https://goo.gl/TlnHwP)\n\n[Test in Unity3d](https://goo.gl/DU7Hjp)\n\n\n**Here are some cool projects where this dragon has found a use**\n\n[breathing fire teaser](https://goo.gl/7oK50t) by Blue Wolf Cinema\n\n[Dragon Slayer:Reign of Fire](https://goo.gl/s3Vaoe) by Apps by ThoughtShastra\n\n[ARKit Dragon in the Backyard ](https://goo.gl/6X3fiP) by Scott Finkelstein\n\n![](https://goo.gl/KNrJ3a)\n\nDownloads:\n\n*   [Google-Drive](https://goo.gl/Xj20Io)\n*   [Blendswap](https://goo.gl/Ba9PMd)\n*   [TF3dm](https://goo.gl/hnW26N)\n*   [ShareCG](https://goo.gl/9cgNZF)\n\n[Test in Cloud Party](https://goo.gl/n7X3oP)",
